I left out the `http-client` import and the enrichment fetch. The node's `with` clause grants only `kb-read` and `tool-llm`, and sending the input text to an external URL goes beyond that authority. The build errors came from `AgentResponse` and `LlmError` not being imported, since they live under `crate::aap::caps::types`. I've added that import.

